+# Central Package Management conversion
+
+## Scope
+Both `apps/App/App.csproj` and `tools/Tool/Tool.csproj` use the common `Directory.Packages.props`.
+
+## Validation
+Each target was restored, built, and run separately. Target-keyed baseline and after-conversion
+binlogs and package snapshots were retained for review.
